#
# Source: references/labs/goad-topology.md. Verify on your build; Ludus/WS2022
# rebuilds keep the stock ansible defaults (21/23 valid in .refinements/2.md).
# Copy to creds.goad and edit for your lab. Blank lines and #comments ignored.
#
